  "reason": "The diagnosis d1 proved that the fallback collector run of P4M attempt a02 happened and that systemd then unloaded the unit, so the a02 invocation-ID proof could not see it. At the owner's request this packet restarts the collector with a journal-based run proof: c1 runs the collector once and proves the run from the journal (a completed start job and the collector's summary line of the same run, no failure or skip entry), self-tested on the a02 run before any effect, then starts the timer; c6 proves a timer-started run the same way; rc stops only the collector service and timer. The stream is never touched. The tool is a separate family copied by value from the accepted P4M tool, the a02-era collector and timer code and the diagnosis journal reader.",
